# passwordkelia

A simple Python package to evaluate password strength and provide a rating score based on common security criteria.

## Installation

```bash
pip install passwordkelia
```

*(Note: If testing from TestPyPI, use `pip install -i https://test.pypi.org/simple/ passwordkelia`)*

## Usage

```python
from kelissword.operations import evaluate_password

# Test a password
result = evaluate_password("MyP@ssw0rd2026!")

print(f"Score: {result['score']}/5")
print(f"Rating: {result['rating']}")
```

## Evaluation Criteria

The evaluator assigns 1 point for each of the following (max 5 points):
- Length >= 8 characters
- Contains at least one lowercase letter
- Contains at least one uppercase letter
- Contains at least one digit
- Contains at least one special character

Ratings range from **Very Weak** to **Very Strong**.
